Although a direct one on one confrontation with a Junkrat is likely to go in Mauga's favor, the risk in fighting a Junkrat is his ability to lay on high, consistent damage from behind his tank with his {{al|Frag Launcher}}. This not only forces you out of aggressive positions, but also allows Junkrat to charge his {{Al|RIP-Tire}} quickly, putting your backline at risk. His {{al|Concussion Mine}} serves as a tool to quickly leave your most effective range, though his lack of horizontal mobility makes your {{al|Overrun}} a great punish in the case he uses both mines. Poke damage from your {{al|Incendiary Chaingun}} will often force a Junkrat out of a sightline if he's unsupported, delaying the threat until you're in a better place to close the distance.

Junkrat's {{al|Steel Trap}} is less of a risk to Mauga compared to some other tanks, since his {{al|Overrun}} causes him to ignore the trap, but getting hit by it can often mean certain death against a coordinated team, or at least force Mauga to use {{al|Cardiac Overdrive}} at an inopportune time.

If you decide to use {{al|Cage Fight}}, make sure Junkrat doesn't have {{al|RIP-Tire}}. Otherwise Mauga have to cancel it or he'll unable to escape the massive damage from the tire (as Mauga's teammates are usually well protected if not in the cage). 

|A Mauga and Junkrat combo can work similarly to the Mauga and Bastion combo, the two creating an area of massive damage potential that most heroes will be eliminated quickly upon entering. Unlike Bastion, though, this combo struggles dealing with longer-range threats, often needing either a speed boost from [[Lúcio|Lucio]] or [[Juno]] to close the distance or a long-range Damage hero like [[Ashe]] to cover for this weakness.
Junkrat is one of the best heroes to combo with Mauga's {{al|Cage Fight}}, being able to deal massive damage if multiple opponent's are trapped in the cage. A Junkrat using {{al|RIP-Tire}} from outside the cage is an especially powerful combo, since the walls of {{al|Cage Fight}} will prevent the enemy from stopping it even if they see it coming. 

